  )
  (text "Safety chain: arming plug (physical) -> fused ARM bus switch = ARM_REQ AND watchdog OK AND OVP_OK -> ARM-only 5 V gate rail."
    (at 20.32 53.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 464be842-3f45-5fdc-bcd9-7833a0796dac)
  )
  (text "OVP_OK: LMV331 comparator on PC_SIG (31.47 bar g on the 070BG, ratiometric) clears a 74LVC1G175 latch; only an ARM_REQ rising edge sets it."
    (at 20.32 57.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid aa424d3c-5a65-5c94-adc1-9edfdc001aad)
  )
  (text "v2.3: MV holding magnet gate = MV latch command AND PRAIL_OK (LTC4365 OV disconnect of the pintle rail, U306)."
    (at 20.32 60.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 53804124-d578-5a6e-a1ce-62bffff36053)
  )
  (text "v2.3: GSE heater interlock J616 closes only with the firmware permit AND no arming plug AND ARM bus off AND watchdog OK."
    (at 20.32 64.77 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f204821f-b73a-5fa4-a880-4394df061955)
  )
